st.face_img_status==1}}"><view class="tips"> 上次保存的照片已成功同步至设备 </view></block><block wx:if="{{numlist.face_img_status==2}}"><view class="tips">{{'上次保存的照片同步失败。原因：'+numlist.face_img_reason+''}}</view></block><block wx:if="{{numlist.is_new_face}}"><view class="btn-box"><button class="btn1" type="primary" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['goreset',['$event']]]]]}}" bindtap="__e">刷新页面</button></view></block><block wx:if="{{!numlist.is_new_face&&numlist.face_img_status==0}}"><view class="btn-box"><button class="btn1" type="primary" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['goresync',['$event']]]]]}}" bindtap="__e">重新同步</button></view></block></view></block></view><view class="title">注意事项</view><view class="text-box"><view class="text1">1.正对手机，背景尽量纯白色。</view><view class="text1">2.露出额头和耳朵，无逆光。</view><view class="text1">3.确保照片中均为本人照片，不能上传其他人的照片，否则会影响开门。</view><view class="text1">4.人脸铺满整个手机屏幕，不要过远或过近。</view><view class="tips-box"><view class="tips-boxs"><view class="tips-icon"><image class="tips-img" src="https://cloud.mrsqfw.com/static/wxapp/images/selfie1.png"></image></view><view class="text2">正对手机</view></view><view class="tips-boxs"><view class="tips-icon"><image class="tips-img" src="https://cloud.mrsqfw.com/static/wxapp/images/selfie3.png"></image></view><view class="text2">光线充足</view></view><view class="tips-boxs"><view class="tips-icon"><image class="tips-img" src="https://cloud.mrsqfw.com/static/wxapp/images/selfie2.png"></image></view><view class="text2">放慢动作</view></view></view></view><view class="btn"><button class="btn-pry" style="{{(btn_style)}}" type="primary" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['uPublishTap',['$event']]]]]}}" bindtap="__e">保存</button></view></block></block><block wx:else><block><view style="width:100%;margin-top:50rpx;text-align:center;font-size:27rpx;color:#666666;"> 此功能不支持 </view></block></block></view>